a-current="page"><div class="max-w-full text-body font-bold text-primary line-clamp-1 break-all min-w-0">丰密</div></a><div class="max-w-full text-body font-normal text-primary flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><span aria-label="Verified account" class="flex cursor-pointer items-center" role="button" tabindex="0" data-base-ui-click-trigger="" id="base-ui-_R_1v5c9pimb6b5336_" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" data-icon="icon-verified-premium-color" viewBox="0 0 24 24" display="flex" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Verified account" class="size-[1em] shrink-0"><path fill="#1d9bf0" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.75c1.4 0 2.62.87 3.34 2.19 1.44-.43 2.92-.17 3.91.81s1.24 2.47.81 3.91c1.32.72 2.2 1.94 2.2 3.34s-.88 2.62-2.2 3.34c.43 1.44.18 2.92-.81 3.9-.99 1-2.47 1.25-3.91.82-.72 1.32-1.94 2.19-3.34 2.19s-2.62-.87-3.34-2.2c-1.44.44-2.92.18-3.9-.8-1-.99-1.24-2.47-.82-3.91-1.32-.72-2.19-1.95-2.19-3.34 0-1.4.87-2.62 2.2-3.34-.43-1.44-.18-2.92.8-3.9.99-1 2.47-1.25 3.91-.82.72-1.32 1.95-2.19 3.34-2.19M10.45 13.3l-2.23-2.25-1.42 1.4 3.7 3.75 6.24-6.77-1.47-1.36z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></div></span><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-[color:inherit] max-w-full min-w-0 active" href="/KuiGas" data-status="active" aria-current="page"><span class="max-w-full text-body font-normal text-secondary line-clamp-1 [font-feature-settings:&#x27;ss01&#x27;]">@KuiGas</span></a></span></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap"><button data-slot="xds-menu-trigger" type="button" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_qqc9pimb6b5336_" aria-label="More" class="group relative inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium select-none transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:opacity-70 h-8 min-w-8 text-subtext1 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 text-primary hover:bg-btn-ghost-hover aria-expanded:bg-btn-ghost-hover active:bg-btn-ghost-pressed w-8 px-0 [&amp;_svg]:transition-transform [&amp;_svg]:duration-200 group-hover:[&amp;_svg]:scale-110 -my-2 shrink-0" style="border-radius:9999px"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center transition-opacity opacity-0"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="animate-spin size-4 text-[color:inherit]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle><path class="opacity-75" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap" style="opacity:1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-more" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12c0-1.1.9-2 2-2s2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2-2-.9-2-2zm9 2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2zm7 0c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><div dir="auto" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text-body font-normal"><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">当我第一次在 AMA 上看到 Jeff </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/chameleon_jeff">@<!-- -->chameleon_jeff</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">时，

台上的他意气风发，谈吐轻松而随意。

那一刻，我心里非常清晰地感受到：

HYPE 的未来，还有很多可以发力的地方。

HYPE 这个创始人，可能会让 CZ 们（交易所老板）感受到前所未有的压力。

我脑海里立刻浮现出两点：

1、HYPE 生态中所有项目的潜在机会点：我之前已经花了很多时间在HYPE生态投研，「生态拼图」里因为有强车头带动，如果考虑生态飞轮效应，局部的财富效应协议应该也会非常明显。

2、我想到的是交易所的产品布局与我们的机会（如Aster，或者其他潜在Aster）

在丰密看来，交易所的最大功能始终是「资产发行+交易」，这两个环节串起来，就是财富创造的闭环，

前者引领财富效应与注意力，后者则构建流动性中心，撮合供需、形成价格。

我把交易所的产品分为：
进攻型产品、护城河产品、旗舰型产品、战略级产品

HYPE如此优秀，其实是蚕食了Binance等一众CEX交易所的市场份额，其实就是抢占了交易所的交易特别是合约模块份额。

试着思考一下，如果HYPE哪一天超过了Binance，如果换位思考CZ大表哥</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/cz_binance">@<!-- -->cz_binance</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">，这是肯定不被希望发生的。CZ 把 Binance 打造得如此成功，表面上当然希望有更多友商、更多巨兽来竞争，

但站在自身角度，他绝不会希望有人真正颠覆 Binance，

蚕食Binance的份额与领先地位，这就像一句老话：

“又怕兄弟哭，又怕兄弟开路虎。”

允许你竞争，但不允许也不希望你把我干趴在沙滩山！

去年底我投资Aster时，核心思考点就是：它到底属于什么类型的产品？

最开始的结论是，Aster是进攻型产品，因为BSC 生态急需一款收益型稳定币 + 衍生品交易的协同产品，而Aster当时提供了asUSDF/asBNB等各种AU积分，永续合约交易则是积累Rh积分，说白了，这种产品既能护城，又能进攻。

随着 CZ 在 Aster 尚未发币前不断喊单，这其实已经表明了：

Binance 想要用 Aster 来对标 HYPE。

但从另一个角度看，Aster 也是 Binance 的护城河产品。Aster随之变成进攻+防守+旗舰产品

Aster发币之后，肉眼可见的是：Aster是战略级产品。

什么是战略级产品，就是

叙事已经决定了它只能成功，不能失败。

只允许成功，不允许失败，

无论谁来做，都必须把它做成。

无论谁来做，都必须把它做成。

无论谁来做，都必须把它做成。

我是这么理解的，也是这么认为的，可能是片面的，

也是我为什么会在之前所说，无论是投，撸，炒，我认为aster是个大机会，我在投了之后，撸了，2级失败了，深刻反思自己在大机会面前的准备不够充分，这种失败其实不可原谅，失败的不是没赚到钱，是因为大机会面前没有足够的聚焦，没有足够的准备。

同样的思路，我一直在想是不是其他类型的产品依然有这样的机会，回来之后我又重新打开YZI LABS </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/yzilabs">@<!-- -->yzilabs</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">投的所有项目，其实已经看了无数变了，但是依然觉得会错过些啥，想看看每个产品到底是亲儿子系列，还是上面所说的产品类型。

1、比如</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/OpenEden_X">@<!-- -->OpenEden_X</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">，这个项目直接上了Binance ，FDV直接飙到10个亿，非常令人意外，但细想之余好像也没问题，我认为这个就是个防守型产品，对标ONDO，OpenEden主攻RWA方向，核心产品是USDO ，全球首个受监管的、完全由代币化美国国债支持的收益型稳定币，投资机构里就只有YZI是2024年9月份做的战投，RWA方向绝对是潜力方向，市场容量与空间非常大。OpenEden 的增长动能持续强劲，许多项目在积分活动结束后 TVL 会回落，而 OpenEden 不仅在上市前保留了大部分 TVL，TGE 之后 TVL 还继续增长，OpenEden 最近宣布了与STBL 和 Plasma 的合作，这种外延扩展，意味着 OpenEden 已经逐步从一个单点产品，走向护城河型生态。

2、比如</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/opinionlabsxyz">@<!-- -->opinionlabsxyz</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">，预测市场，</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/Polymarket">@<!-- -->Polymarket</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">已经有发币苗头了，团队已经释放一些消息，也有博主给出9B估值，毫无疑问项目方是希望FDV直接百亿美金起步，取了个中间值，试试市场热度。另外就Limitless </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/trylimitless">@<!-- -->trylimitless</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">，马上要在kaito打新，热度也很高，YZI投领投的这个O.LAB  </span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/opinionlabsxyz">@<!-- -->opinionlabsxyz</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">，也是个预测市场，重点是BSC生态的，重点跟踪吧！

3、比如</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/StableStock">@<!-- -->StableStock</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">，专注于股票市场的 RWA 协议，yzi做了种子轮投资，这个方向的天花板无敌高，关注就对了。

4、比如</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/brevis_zk">@<!-- -->brevis_zk</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> ZK全链数据公证平台，Celer Network 联合创始人董沫老师做的，也是iosg合伙人，重点是nomad也在其列，应该是个潜在的buildpad标的。未来binance是稳了。卧槽，我真想投点啊。

5、比如</span><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring hover:underline max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] text-brand" href="/aPriori">@<!-- -->aPriori</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> 这个是monad原生协议，monad马上要发币了，aPriori 是其生态最重磅协议之一，MEV 基础设施和流动性质押，最近上了活动，无脑冲就对了。

6、等空了继续补充，

诚然，撸毛人/投资人，其实是投研人Alpha 人，本质上是要做信息与逻辑的先知。</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="relative"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="relative h-0" style="padding-bottom:68%"><div class="absolute -inset-0.5"><div class="group/carousel relative h-full"><div class="h-full w-full"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex overflow-x-auto gap-1 h-full snap-x snap-mandatory overscroll-x-contain py-0.5 -ms-3.5 -me-3.5 ps-4 pe-4"><div class="border-normal h-full min-h-0 min-w-[auto] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-sm border" style="aspect-ratio:1.1764705882352942"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" aria-label="Image" href="/KuiGas/status/1974377844282437765/photo/1"><img fetchPriority="high" height="1280" width="1707" alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" decoding="async" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2Zh85-bMAQ9Rzp?format=webp&amp;name=large" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2Zh85-bMAQ9Rzp?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2Zh85-bMAQ9Rzp?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2Zh85-bMAQ9Rzp?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/KuiGas/status/1974377844282437765/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="border-normal h-full min-h-0 min-w-[auto] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-sm border" style="aspect-ratio:1.1764705882352942"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a class="rounded-xs focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring max-w-full text-[length:inherit] font-[inherit] block h-full